flowchart TD
  %% Inputs
  A[Shopper Input]
  A1[nlQuery]
  A2[Preferences: dietaryTags]
  A3[Toggles: force Sonnet]
  A4[policyMode: semi/fully]
  A5[Engine availability env]
  A --> A1
  A --> A2
  A --> A3
  A --> A4
  A --> A5

  B[Analyse Query Context]
  C[Compute Signals: coreTokens, budget, diet count]
  D[Compute Complexity Score]
  A1 --> B
  A2 --> B
  A3 --> B
  A4 --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D

  E{Policy Mode}
  D --> E
  F[Call Haiku Policy Model]
  G[Heuristic Policy Decision]
  E -->|Haiku configured| F
  E -->|No policy model| G

  H{Proposed Action}
  F --> H
  G --> H

  subgraph GR[Guardrails & Availability]
    I{Action Available?}
    H --> I
    J[Downgrade: Premier -> Express -> Sonnet -> Elastic]
    K[Keep Action]
    I -->|No| J --> K
    I -->|Yes| K
    L{Safety Rules}
    K --> L
    M[Prefer Elastic-only for very short queries]
    N[Disallow Titan Express if complexity LT 5 unless forced]
    O[Disallow Titan Premier if complexity LT 8]
    P[Prefer Sonnet if force Sonnet ON]
    L --> M
    L --> N
    L --> O
    L --> P
    Q[Resolved Action]
    M --> Q
    N --> Q
    O --> Q
    P --> Q
    K --> Q
  end

  R[Return OOD message + meta + log]
  Q -->|reject_out_of_domain| R

  S[Resolved: Elastic-only]
  T[Resolved: Sonnet]
  U[Resolved: Titan Express]
  V[Resolved: Titan Premier]
  Q -->|elastic_only| S
  Q -->|elastic_plus_sonnet| T
  Q -->|elastic_plus_titan_express| U
  Q -->|elastic_plus_titan_premier| V

  subgraph LOG[Policy Logging]
    direction TB
    W[Log decision to Elastic - query prefs action vs resolvedAction confidence reason complexity final_model]
  end

  X[Execute: Elastic MCP only]
  Y[Execute: Elastic + Sonnet reasoning]
  Z[Execute: Elastic + Titan Express reasoning]
  AA[Execute: Elastic + Titan Premier reasoning]
  S --> W --> X
  T --> W --> Y
  U --> W --> Z
  V --> W --> AA
